<title>JAPAN: Yasuda Trust aims to write off bad loans by Mar 98.</title>
<headline>Yasuda Trust aims to write off bad loans by Mar 98.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yasuda Trust &amp; Banking Co Ltd said on Monday it wants to complete writing off its bad loan holdings by March 1998.  </p>
<p>A Yasuda official told reporters that the bank forecasts operating profit of 140 billion yen for the full business year ending next March 31.  </p>
<p>In the current business year, Yasuda plans to write off non-performing loans worth 320 billion yen, the official said.</p>
